This project is inspired by Andrej Karpathy's autoresearch:
https://github.com/karpathy/autoresearch

The autoresearch pattern — giving an AI agent a real experiment setup and letting
it iterate autonomously — was conceived and demonstrated by Andrej Karpathy.
This MCP server generalizes that pattern into a composable technique catalog and
experiment tracking system accessible through the Model Context Protocol.

This project does not contain any code from the original autoresearch repository.
It is an independent implementation inspired by the methodology.
